====================================================================================================
dd/dalpha|_CP  printed  = -6.0567149344e-11   identity -2/(5 beta d_CP) = -6.0567149344e-11
Eq.(16) alpha^2 coeff   = 1.4275276630e-16   identity 4/(25 beta^2 d_CP^3) = 1.4275276630e-16
16^(1/5)/5 = 0.34822   (the prefactor Eq. 23 drops; brief 0.34822)
RELATIVE coordinate d2d/dalpha^2 = (4/25)(...)^(1/5) = 2.855055e-16   (brief 2.855e-16)
PER-ION       d2x/dalpha^2 = +-(2/25)(...)^(1/5)     = 1.427528e-16   (exactly half; CORRECT as printed)
  ratio = 2.0000000 (exactly 2); substituting 4/25 per ion doubles the per-ion kick
  4/25 = 0.1600, 2/25 = 0.0800
chi from Eq.(26) with 4/25 = 9.0382279192e-02;  printed Eq.(27) = 9.0382279192e-02;  ratio - 1 = 2.665e-15
chi = 1 at alpha_dot_CP = 3.326e+11 V m^-2 s^-1   (brief 3.32e11)
