====================================================================================================
printed   quintic: P(0) = +0.0, P(T) = -1.0, P'(0) = +0.0, P'(T) = +0.0, P''(0) = +0.0, P''(T) = +0.0
corrected quintic: P(0) = +0.0, P(T) = +1.0, P'(0) = +0.0, P'(T) = +0.0, P''(0) = +0.0, P''(T) = +0.0
sin^2 ramp: P(T) = +1.0, P''(0) T^2 = +4.934802 = pi^2/2 = 4.934802 (non-vanishing)

