====================================================================================================
Gamma_h(1 MHz)    = 6.300 /ms
Gamma_h(0.18 MHz) = 140.4 /ms   (brief 140/ms; Fig. 6 inset peak ~145-148/ms)
implied noise exponent a = 1.81 - 1 = 0.81 (inside the reported 0.5 to 2.5 band)
  illustrative ramp, T =    6 us: Delta n_th = T * I = 0.0787 quanta (I = 1.3109e+04 s^-1)
  illustrative ramp, T =   20 us: Delta n_th = T * I = 0.2622 quanta (I = 1.3109e+04 s^-1)
  illustrative ramp, T =   70 us: Delta n_th = T * I = 0.9177 quanta (I = 1.3109e+04 s^-1)
  Delta n_th is strictly PROPORTIONAL to T; the source's prose '1/T' contradicts its own Eq. (32) and Fig. 6

