9. Splitting: trap-size scaling of the attainable quartic confinement
====================================================================================================
d_eff = (w^2 + h^2 + d^2)^(1/2) = 512.35 um
implied SI prefactor beta_CP d_eff^4 = 17.71 V   (brief 17.7 V)
printed 2.2e24 V with d_eff in m  -> 3.193e+37 V/m^4 (23 orders too large)
printed 2.2e24 V with d_eff in um -> 3.193e+13 V/m^4 (8x too small)
  -> use the d_eff^-4 EXPONENT only; the printed prefactor is unusable in every convention

